          </h2>

          <p>
            We looked for written statements on rennet or vegetarian status from the brands most likely to end up in a vegetarian's cart. The answers range from explicit to silent. The table summarizes what we could find at the time of writing; brand help pages change, so treat it as a starting point and check the current page before you buy.
          </p>

